.el .ds Aq '
.TH ferry-completions 1  Ferry "Ferry Manual"
.SH NAME
ferry\-completions \- Print the shell completion script, e.g. `ferry completions bash > ~/.local/share/bash\-completion/completions/ferry` (packages install it already)
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBferry completions\fR [\fB\-\-lang\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] <\fISHELL\fR> 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Print the shell completion script, e.g. `ferry completions bash > ~/.local/share/bash\-completion/completions/ferry` (packages install it already)
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-lang\fR \fI<CODE>\fR
Interface language for this run (`en`, `pl`); overrides the saved setting
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
.TP
<\fISHELL\fR>
Shell to complete in
.br

.br
\fIPossible values:\fR
.RS 14
.IP \(bu 2
bash
.IP \(bu 2
elvish
.IP \(bu 2
fish
.IP \(bu 2
powershell
.IP \(bu 2
zsh
.RE
